;sequence

THE SEQUENCE IS NUMBERED BASED ON THE BOVINE PANCREATIC 
PHOSPHOLIPASE A2. SO, NOT SEQUENTIAL NUMBERS INDICATE 
DELETIONS AND INSERTIONS REGIONS IN COMPARISON WITH BOVINE 
PANCREATIC PLA2.
